/E (Managing student-council elections manually can take a lot of time and may cause mistakes while recording student details, candidate details, and votes. Counting votes manually can also lead to errors, and there is a chance of students voting more than once if proper records are not maintained. To solve these issues, we developed a simple Java-based system that organizes the election process, records votes, prevents duplicate voting, counts votes accurately, and displays the final results.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
